SUMMARY:A Domino Train Wreck Game afternoon
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nYou are convivially invited to an evening o
 f raucous laughter and abandon while playing (a simplified) **Mexican Trai
 n Wreck Dominoes**.\nThis event is for beginners and/or for those who do N
 OT take gaming seriously. This is a ‘social’ event.\nThere will be no 
 ‘Book of Hoyle’. There will be no ‘scorekeeping’. Bring yo' funnyb
 one!!\n**ENTRY FEE**: Free\n***Social hour at 1:30 pm***\nEnjoy a large\, 
 climate-controlled indoor area.\nAsst’d beers\, wines\, water & soft dri
 nks available.\nA Mexican Food Truck is available\n**You are encouraged to
  purchase drink at the venue.**\n**Optional:** You may bring (non-messy) f
 inger food. (to share if you like).\ngordie's contact: CurmudgeonHiker@gma
 il.com\n828.393.0297 (text only)
