 's.\n\nWe're looking forward to being at this new venue!\n\nThey have wine
 \, beer\, cider and soft drinks. There's no food truck on site so feel fre
 e to bring snacks.\n\nCome help us support this new local business.\n\nPle
 ase be sure to purchase something.
